<title>TUNISIA: PRESS DIGEST - Tunisia - Sept 23.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Tunisia - Sept 23.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the leading stories in the Tunisian press on Monday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>LA PRESSE</p>
<p>- President Ben Ali congratulates King Fahd at the occasion of Saudi Arabia National Day.</p>
<p>- Tunisia aims at creating 10 square metres of green area per inhabitant by the year 2001.</p>
<p>LE TEMPS</p>
<p>- Used clothes market seen flourishing all around the country. Most of them imported at a low price from the United States.</p>
</text>
